(4,7,'213','dfsdfsf','---\ntemplate_type: weekly\n---\n[주차] 2026-W27\n\n[이번 주 배운 내용]\n2313\n\n[코드]\n# 코드를 입력하세요\ndsadawead\\c\nd\nd\nc\ndgvb\n#dswedawd\n\n[실행 결과]\nwadad\n\n[알고리즘 설명]\nsadw\n\n[배운 점]\ndawdaxsd',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"/uploads/portfolio/portfolio_7_y3pvg0r8.jpg\"]','AI로봇(7월1주차)','{\"comment\":true}',1,'approved',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 11:28:39','2026-08-07 15:24:21'),
