(22,18,'DC 모터 - Coding','강의 콘텐츠','lecture',NULL,NULL,0,0,'<h2>DC 모터 - 정회전 코드</h2>\n<pre class=\"code-block cpp\"><code>int A1A = 8;\nint A1B = 9;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(A1A, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(A1B, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  analogWrite(A1A, 255);   // 최대 속도\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\n}</code></pre>\n<h2>DC 모터 - 역회전 코드</h2>\n<pre class=\"code-block cpp\"><code>int A1A = 8;\nint A1B = 9;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(A1A, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(A1B, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  analogWrite(A1A, 0);\n  analogWrite(A1B, 255);\n}</code></pre>\n<h2>DC 모터 - 정지 코드</h2>\n<pre class=\"code-block cpp\"><code>int A1A = 8;\nint A1B = 9;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(A1A, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(A1B, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  analogWrite(A1A, 0);\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\n}</code></pre>','[{\"type\": \"heading\", \"content\": \"DC 모터 - 정회전 코드\"}, {\"type\": \"code\", \"code\": \"int A1A = 8;\\nint A1B = 9;\\n\\nvoid setup() {\\n  pinMode(A1A, OUTPUT);\\n  pinMode(A1B, OUTPUT);\\n}\\n\\nvoid loop() {\\n  analogWrite(A1A, 255);   // 최대 속도\\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\\n}\", \"language\": \"cpp\"}, {\"type\": \"heading\", \"content\": \"DC 모터 - 역회전 코드\"}, {\"type\": \"code\", \"code\": \"int A1A = 8;\\nint A1B = 9;\\n\\nvoid setup() {\\n  pinMode(A1A, OUTPUT);\\n  pinMode(A1B, OUTPUT);\\n}\\n\\nvoid loop() {\\n  analogWrite(A1A, 0);\\n  analogWrite(A1B, 255);\\n}\", \"language\": \"cpp\"}, {\"type\": \"heading\", \"content\": \"DC 모터 - 정지 코드\"}, {\"type\": \"code\", \"code\": \"int A1A = 8;\\nint A1B = 9;\\n\\nvoid setup() {\\n  pinMode(A1A, OUTPUT);\\n  pinMode(A1B, OUTPUT);\\n}\\n\\nvoid loop() {\\n  analogWrite(A1A, 0);\\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\\n}\", \"language\": \"cpp\"}]',30,1,1,'2026-07-16 05:28:06','2026-08-29 03:05:47',''),
(26,18,'DC 모터 - 다중제어 Coding','강의 콘텐츠','lecture',NULL,NULL,0,0,'<h2>DC 모터 - 전진 → 정지 → 후진 반복</h2>\n<pre class=\"code-block cpp\"><code>int A1A = 8;\nint A1B = 9;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(A1A, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(A1B, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n\n  // 정회전\n  analogWrite(A1A, 200);\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\n  delay(3000);\n\n  // 정지\n  analogWrite(A1A, 0);\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\n  delay(1000);\n\n  // 역회전\n  analogWrite(A1A, 0);\n  analogWrite(A1B, 200);\n  delay(3000);\n\n  // 정지\n  analogWrite(A1A, 0);\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\n  delay(1000);\n}</code></pre>\n<h2>DC 모터 - 속도제어</h2>\n<pre class=\"code-block cpp\"><code>int A1A = 8;\nint A1B = 9;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(A1A, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(A1B, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n\n  analogWrite(A1A, 50);\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\n  delay(2000);\n\n  analogWrite(A1A, 100);\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\n  delay(2000);\n\n  analogWrite(A1A, 180);\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\n  delay(2000);\n\n  analogWrite(A1A, 255);\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\n  delay(2000);\n}</code></pre>','[{\"type\": \"heading\", \"content\": \"DC 모터 - 전진 → 정지 → 후진 반복\"}, {\"type\": \"code\", \"code\": \"int A1A = 8;\\nint A1B = 9;\\n\\nvoid setup() {\\n  pinMode(A1A, OUTPUT);\\n  pinMode(A1B, OUTPUT);\\n}\\n\\nvoid loop() {\\n\\n  // 정회전\\n  analogWrite(A1A, 200);\\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\\n  delay(3000);\\n\\n  // 정지\\n  analogWrite(A1A, 0);\\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\\n  delay(1000);\\n\\n  // 역회전\\n  analogWrite(A1A, 0);\\n  analogWrite(A1B, 200);\\n  delay(3000);\\n\\n  // 정지\\n  analogWrite(A1A, 0);\\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\\n  delay(1000);\\n}\", \"language\": \"cpp\"}, {\"type\": \"heading\", \"content\": \"DC 모터 - 속도제어\"}, {\"type\": \"code\", \"code\": \"int A1A = 8;\\nint A1B = 9;\\n\\nvoid setup() {\\n  pinMode(A1A, OUTPUT);\\n  pinMode(A1B, OUTPUT);\\n}\\n\\nvoid loop() {\\n\\n  analogWrite(A1A, 50);\\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\\n  delay(2000);\\n\\n  analogWrite(A1A, 100);\\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\\n  delay(2000);\\n\\n  analogWrite(A1A, 180);\\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\\n  delay(2000);\\n\\n  analogWrite(A1A, 255);\\n  analogWrite(A1B, 0);\\n  delay(2000);\\n}\", \"language\": \"cpp\"}]',50,1,1,'2026-07-16 05:30:15','2026-09-04 05:07:49',''),
(27,18,'터치 센서 - Coding','강의 콘텐츠','lecture',NULL,NULL,0,0,'<h2>터치 센서 - 시리얼모니터 (센서 값) 출력</h2>\n<pre class=\"code-block python\"><code>int touchPin = 11;\n\nvoid setup() {\n\n  pinMode(touchPin, INPUT);\n\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n\n  int Result = digitalRead(touchPin);\n\n  Serial.println(Result);\n\n  delay(200);\n\n}</code></pre>\n<h2>터치 센서 - 시리얼모니터 (상태 text) 출력</h2>\n<pre class=\"code-block cpp\"><code>int touchPin = 11;\n\nvoid setup() {\n\n  pinMode(touchPin, INPUT);\n\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n\n  if (digitalRead(touchPin) == HIGH) {\n\n    Serial.println(\"Touch!\");\n\n  }\n  else {\n\n    Serial.println(\"No Touch\");\n\n  }\n\n  delay(200);\n\n}</code></pre>','[{\"type\": \"heading\", \"content\": \"터치 센서 - 시리얼모니터 (센서 값) 출력\"}, {\"type\": \"code\", \"code\": \"int touchPin = 11;\\n\\nvoid setup() {\\n\\n  pinMode(touchPin, INPUT);\\n\\n  Serial.begin(9600);\\n\\n}\\n\\nvoid loop() {\\n\\n  int Result = digitalRead(touchPin);\\n\\n  Serial.println(Result);\\n\\n  delay(200);\\n\\n}\", \"language\": \"python\"}, {\"type\": \"heading\", \"content\": \"터치 센서 - 시리얼모니터 (상태 text) 출력\"}, {\"type\": \"code\", \"code\": \"int touchPin = 11;\\n\\nvoid setup() {\\n\\n  pinMode(touchPin, INPUT);\\n\\n  Serial.begin(9600);\\n\\n}\\n\\nvoid loop() {\\n\\n  if (digitalRead(touchPin) == HIGH) {\\n\\n    Serial.println(\\\"Touch!\\\");\\n\\n  }\\n  else {\\n\\n    Serial.println(\\\"No Touch\\\");\\n\\n  }\\n\\n  delay(200);\\n\\n}\", \"language\": \"cpp\"}]',40,1,1,'2026-07-16 05:32:07','2026-09-04 05:07:49',''),
